                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-a-7">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">What is the number of students I can expect in a class?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-7">You can expect a class size of upto 60 students.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-a-8">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Is Masters' Union affiliated to a university or UGC approved?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-8">
                            Masters' Union has received a Letter of Intent from the Government of Haryana to be
                            established as a private university, upon which it will be recognised under the UGC.
                        </p>
                    </div>

